{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1622979925"}, "name":{"label":"CalmDog0301"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-04-25T06:06:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.88.1"}, "id":{"label":"12584260469"}, "title":{"label":"THE BEST APP EVER"}, "content":{"label":"I love this app after downloading I was able to now track my water intake, with a cute llama helping me track. It has all different tasks as well as a tracker, and gives insights to the benefits of drinking certain things or doing an all water diet. The only downside is that I think the other drinks to track should be free and then this app would be amazing with no downsides what so ever!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
