{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id546948574"}, "name":{"label":"positivepetal123"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-04-08T13:46:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.87.0"}, "id":{"label":"12519963378"}, "title":{"label":"The best"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve tried so many water tracker apps and a Hidrate water bottle - this beats them all! I bought the full version within 2 minutes of having the app 😆 The graphics are so cute, colourful and the perfect aesthetic. It’s so simple and intuitive to use, I love that I can add all the drinks I want and their hydration levels. I drink a lot of different herbal teas so being able to track all the different ones is great. I love the challenges and unlocking new characters. It’s just enough gamifying to keep my attention without being too complicated and OTT. Thank you water llama team!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
