{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1205699063"}, "name":{"label":"cutieSends"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-02-21T12:28:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.87.0"}, "id":{"label":"12338738899"}, "title":{"label":"A little bit unfair but still amazing"}, "content":{"label":"There are a few reasons that you should get this App \n\n1. The simplicity of this app makes it so easy and fun to use which means you can  easily use it without being confused\n\n2. The app tells you how much water you drink overtime..which  can tell you how much you have improved \n\n3. You can customise the widget app with colours and make it aesthetic \n\n4. You can see everything laid out so everything’s right there and like I said all functions easy to find and use \n\nNow here are some reasons why it’s unfair.. and you should keep in mind. \n\n1. The app does make you pay for multiple drinks on your balance which is a little unfair because if you download a drinking app you should be able to drink other things than water for free.\n\n2. The app customisation doesn't come with a custom colour picker which only leaves you with generic colours\n\n3. The app offers advice but makes you pay to start a milestone thing.. you’ll see \n\n4. THIS APP ESPECIALLY GIVES YOU A DISCOUNT BUT YOU HAVE  TO BUY WHEN OFFER IS FRESH BUT IT ONLY GIVES YOU LIKE 5 MINUTES \n\nthat’s all but other than that the app slays and you should keep all I said in mind tho", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
